{
  "name": "lib_reserve_in_app",
  "description": "Default goal (reserve) opened the app's way (/library-service/). Follow the cards: 關鍵字搜尋, type 神奇柑仔店, 放大鏡, pick the reservable book (lib-book-5), 取書館, ✕, 預約.",
  "page": "library",
  "capability": "library",
  "goals": [],
